{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>The fifth meaning</b><br>For (הנה) the winter. Targum [renders] חורף [as] סתוא." "חלף. Cut down, like כליל יחלוף." "<b>The third meaning</b><br>הסתיו [passed]. From the root אבר." "The rain. The days of bondage and the teacher."], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {0 "Bracketed [סתוא] appears to be the Aramaic equivalent of חורף; retained as in the source."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:44:01.692288029Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}